# Six-element plastic aspheric phone lens, f = 2.97 mm, F/2.45, HFOV 37.2 deg, TTL 3.73 mm.
# US 8,390,940 B2 (Largan Precision, "Photographing optical lens assembly"), Embodiment 1,
# Table 1-1 (aspheric coefficients of Table 1-2 in phone_6p_2.97mm.asphere.yaml).
# Not in the patent: clear apertures (traced: all rays through the full stop for 0..37.2 deg, +5 %;
# row 9 (K = 15.8) is undefined beyond r = 1.101 mm, which vignettes the upper rim at full field);
# the stop row has the patent's -0.120 mm (stop 0.12 mm behind the L1 vertex; pbrt patch 0004
# treats a negative-thickness stop as a virtual clipping plane). The 0.2 mm IR-cut plate is
# omitted (open-cam applies the IR-cut filter spectrally); the last gap is the air-equivalent
# back focus 0.500 + 0.200/1.517 + 0.305, and pbrt refocuses it anyway.
